+/*
+* DVD-Audio Decoder plugin
+* Copyright (c) 2009-2022 Maxim V.Anisiutkin <maxim.anisiutkin@gmail.com>
+*
+* DVD-Audio Decoder is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
