@@ -0,0 +1,831 @@
+/*
+* MPD SACD Decoder plugin
+* Copyright (c) 2017-2023 Maxim V.Anisiutkin <maxim.anisiutkin@gmail.com>
+*
+* This module partially uses code from SACD Ripper http://code.google.com/p/sacd-ripper/ project
